{"product_id":"the-ugly-truth","title":"The ugly truth","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe massively funny fifth book in the bestselling and award-winning Diary of a Wimpy Kid series - now in paperback. Greg Heffley has always been in a hurry to grow up. But is getting older really all it's cracked up to be? Suddenly Greg is dealing with the pressures of boy-girl parties, increased responsibilities, and even the awkward changes that come with getting older. And after a fight with his best friend Rowley, it looks like Greg is going to have to face the \"ugly truth\" all by himself . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeff Kinney\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141340821\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595583197337,"sku":"3RC9780141340821","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-ugly-truth-229092.jpg?v=1752150888","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-ugly-truth","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}